      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ah, it looked to me like there might be some padding there for it to grow into, given that it\u0027s sandwiched between two pointer types.\n\nRunning pahole shows that should be the case:\n\n```\n$ pahole -C public_key_signature vmlinux\nstruct public_key_signature {\n\tstruct asymmetric_key_id * auth_ids[2];          /*     0    16 */\n\tu8 *                       s;                    /*    16     8 */\n\tu32                        s_size;               /*    24     4 */\n\n\t/* XXX 4 bytes hole, try to pack */\n\n\tu8 *                       digest;               /*    32     8 */\n\tu8                         digest_size;          /*    40     1 */\n\n\t/* XXX 7 bytes hole, try to pack */\n\n\tconst char  *              pkey_algo;            /*    48     8 */\n\tconst char  *              hash_algo;            /*    56     8 */\n\t/* --- cacheline 1 boundary (64 bytes) --- */\n\tconst char  *              encoding;             /*    64     8 */\n\tconst void  *              data;                 /*    72     8 */\n\tunsigned int               data_size;            /*    80     4 */\n\n\t/* size: 88, cachelines: 2, members: 10 */\n\t/* sum members: 73, holes: 2, sum holes: 11 */\n\t/* padding: 4 */\n\t/* last cacheline: 24 bytes */\n};\n\n```\n\nand with the change:\n\n```\nstruct public_key_signature {\n\tstruct asymmetric_key_id * auth_ids[2];          /*     0    16 */\n\tu8 *                       s;                    /*    16     8 */\n\tu32                        s_size;               /*    24     4 */\n\n\t/* XXX 4 bytes hole, try to pack */\n\n\tu8 *                       digest;               /*    32     8 */\n\tu32                        digest_size;          /*    40     4 */\n\n\t/* XXX 4 bytes hole, try to pack */\n\n\tconst char  *              pkey_algo;            /*    48     8 */\n\tconst char  *              hash_algo;            /*    56     8 */\n\t/* --- cacheline 1 boundary (64 bytes) --- */\n\tconst char  *              encoding;             /*    64     8 */\n\tconst void  *              data;                 /*    72     8 */\n\tunsigned int               data_size;            /*    80     4 */\n\n\t/* size: 88, cachelines: 2, members: 10 */\n\t/* sum members: 76, holes: 2, sum holes: 8 */\n\t/* padding: 4 */\n\t/* last cacheline: 24 bytes */\n};\n\n```",
